    <briefdescription>
<para>SQL语句的流式构建器实现 </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>通过链式调用构建复杂的SQL语句，避免手动拼接SQL字符串的安全风险。</para>
<para><bold>支持的语句类型：</bold><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>DML: SELECT, INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>DDL: CREATE TABLE, ALTER TABLE, DROP TABLE, TRUNCATE TABLE</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>视图: CREATE VIEW, DROP VIEW</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>索引: CREATE INDEX, DROP INDEX</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>集合操作: UNION / UNION ALL / INTERSECT / INTERSECT ALL / EXCEPT / EXCEPT ALL</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>CTE: WITH / WITH RECURSIVE</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>窗口函数: ROW_NUMBER, RANK, DENSE_RANK, NTILE, LEAD, LAG, FIRST_VALUE, LAST_VALUE</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>表达式工具: CASE, CAST</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>聚合: COUNT, SUM, AVG, MAX, MIN</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<sect1 id="group___s_m_t_p_1standards">
<title>遵循的国际标准</title><para>本构建器生成的语法遵循以下国际标准：<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><bold>ISO/IEC 9075:1992</bold> (SQL-92) Entry 级及 Intermediate 级核心语法 <ulink url="https://www.iso.org/standard/16663.html">https://www.iso.org/standard/16663.html</ulink></para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>ISO/IEC 9075-2:1999</bold> (SQL:1999/Foundation) CTE、派生表与子查询增强 <ulink url="https://www.iso.org/standard/26196.html">https://www.iso.org/standard/26196.html</ulink></para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>ISO/IEC 9075-2:2003</bold> (SQL:2003/Foundation) 窗口函数 (ROW_NUMBER / RANK / 等)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>ISO/IEC 9075-2:2008</bold> (SQL:2008/Foundation) TRUNCATE TABLE, FETCH FIRST 分页</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>ISO/IEC 9075-4:2023</bold> (SQL/PSM) 预编译占位符相关约定 <ulink url="https://www.iso.org/standard/76584.html">https://www.iso.org/standard/76584.html</ulink></para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>同时覆盖以下事实标准（跨数据库厂商通用，非 ANSI 标准正文）：<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>CREATE INDEX / DROP INDEX</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>CREATE [OR REPLACE] VIEW</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>IF [NOT] EXISTS 修饰子句</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>AUTO_INCREMENT 自增列 (MySQL/SQLite)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>LIMIT / OFFSET 分页 (MySQL/PostgreSQL/SQLite)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="group___s_q_l_1compatibility">
<title>数据库兼容性</title><para>生成的 SQL 语句适用于以下主流关系型数据库：<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>MySQL 5.7+</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>PostgreSQL 9.0+</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>SQLite 3.0+</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Microsoft SQL Server 2008+</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Oracle Database 10g+</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>所有其他遵循 ANSI SQL 标准的数据库</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><computeroutput>LIMIT</computeroutput>/<computeroutput>OFFSET</computeroutput> 是事实标准，被除 Oracle 外的多数数据库支持。 对 Oracle 12c+，建议使用 fetch_first() 生成 <computeroutput>FETCH FIRST n ROWS ONLY</computeroutput>。</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>构建器生成的 SQL 骨架使用 <computeroutput>?</computeroutput> 占位符；实际参数绑定与转义由驱动程序处理。</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</simplesect>
</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="group___s_q_l_1exclusions">
<title>有意不纳入的特性及原因</title><para>以下 SQL 特性在标准中有定义但本构建器 **不提供 API 支持**。 用户可通过传入原始 SQL 字符串（如 where()、having() 等）自由使用这些特性。</para>
<para><table rows="11" cols="3"><row>
<entry thead="yes"><para>特性  </para>
</entry><entry thead="yes"><para>标准出处  </para>
</entry><entry thead="yes"><para>不纳入原因  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para>GRANT / REVOKE  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>SQL-92 Entry  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>DCL（数据控制语言），属于运维授权范畴，与 DML/DDL 性质不同  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para>CREATE SCHEMA / DOMAIN / ASSERTION  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>SQL-92 Intermediate  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>生产代码中极少使用；多数数据库实现不完整或语义差异大  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para>TRIGGER / 存储过程 / 函数  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>SQL:1999 / SQL/PSM  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>过程式代码（含控制流），超出声明式 SQL 构建器的设计范围  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para>SAVEPOINT / RELEASE SAVEPOINT  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>SQL:1999  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>事务控制原语，粒度与连接层绑定；使用频率低  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para>MERGE (UPSERT)  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>SQL:2003  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>各数据库方言差异极大（MySQL ON DUPLICATE KEY / PostgreSQL ON CONFLICT / SQLite INSERT OR REPLACE），统一 API 会掩盖方言行为差异  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para>CREATE SEQUENCE / ALTER SEQUENCE  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>SQL:2003  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>多数项目通过 ORM 或迁移脚本管理序列，不适合运行时 SQL 构建器  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para>MATCH / OVERLAPS / UNIQUE 谓词  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>SQL-92 Full  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>边缘用例；多数数据库未实现或语义不完整，生产代码中几乎不会使用  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para>LATERAL JOIN  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>SQL:1999  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>使用率极低；可通过子查询或 CROSS JOIN 改写  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para>IDENTITY 列 (GENERATED AS IDENTITY)  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>SQL:2003  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>与 AUTO_INCREMENT 功能重叠；各数据库语法差异大 (GENERATED ALWAYS AS IDENTITY / GENERATED BY DEFAULT AS IDENTITY / IDENTITY(1,1))  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para>TEMPORARY TABLE (会话临时表)  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>SQL-92 Full  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>本构建器已支持 CREATE TEMP TABLE (事实标准语法)  </para>
</entry></row>
</table>
</para>
</sect1>
    </detaileddescription>
